n Bieling","role":"Raban","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5gZz1Kc8LE77npKZaWp7SbjjPDt.jpg"},{"id":1857353,"name":"Anne Mühlmeier","role":"Horizon","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/quyUjHsJUbKJVcP1VPBb7zCuToy.jpg"},{"id":932217,"name":"Janina Fautz","role":"Klette","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zlsaGaXr3ctSVpQPONCpRfsJcmg.jpg"},{"id":682,"name":"Uwe Ochsenknecht","role":"Vater von Maxi","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mlNKDWmAxUIqLT4ZfW1REo7MoOD.jpg"},{"id":226669,"name":"David Bode","role":"Erik – die Wölfe"},{"id":1857354,"name":"Franziska Brand","role":"Freya – die Wölfe"},{"id":1857355,"name":"Laura Bruckbauer","role":"Koyote Karl-Heinz – die Wölfe"},{"id":1857356,"name":"Matthias Bernkopf","role":"Tronje – die Wölfe"},{"id":1857357,"name":"Lucas Mannhardt","role":"Giliad – die Wölfe"},{"id":1857358,"name":"Patrick Stöver","role":"Run – die Wölfe"},{"id":1857359,"name":"Luca Debole","role":"Bern – die Wölfe"},{"id":1857360,"name":"Tobias Fahlberg","role":"Jaromir – die Silberlichten"},{"id":1857361,"name":"Peter Rahn","role":"die Silberlichten"},{"id":1857362,"name":"Alexander Hackelsberger","role":"die Silberlichten"},{"id":1857363,"name":"Fabian Gusta","role":"die Silberlichten"},{"id":1857364,"name":"Matthias Walkner","role":"die Silberlichten"},{"id":1857365,"name":"Stephan Schrattenecker","role":"die Silberlichten"},{"id":1391177,"name":"Leonie Kranzle","role":"Britta"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"La tribù del pallone 4","overview":"Dopo la vittoria contro le Vipere Striscianti, per la tribù del pallone rimane soltanto un traguardo da raggiungere: la Coppa di Calcio Freestyle. I loro rivali, i Lupi, non sono avversari normali. Nella nebbia attorno la loro fortezza, Ragnarök, si nasconde un misterioso potere: Horizon e i Silver Lights."},{"language":"en-US","title":"The Wild Soccer Bunch 4","overview":"With the victory against \"The Beastly Beasts\", \"The Wild Soccer Bunch\" showed it to everyone and then won every single game. Only one victory now separates them from the \"Pott\", the Freestyle Soccer Cup. For this they have to compete against the \"Wolves of Ragnarök\". But the wolves are not normal opponents! They have a dark secret - and behind them lurks a power stronger than all of them: the girl Horizon and the \"Silver Lights\" from the fog...","tagline":"The Attack of the Silver Lights"},{"language":"de-DE","overview":"Mit dem Sieg gegen die “Biestigen Biester” haben die Wilden Kerle es allen gezeigt und danach jedes Spiel gewonnen. Nur ein Sieg trennt sie jetzt noch vom “Pott”, dem Freestyle-Soccer-Pokal. Dafür müssen sie gegen die “Wölfe von Ragnarök” antreten. Doch die Wölfe sind keine normalen Gegner! Sie haben ein dunkles Geheimnis – und hinter ihnen lauert eine Macht, die stärker ist als sie alle: das Mädchen Horizon und die Silberlichten aus dem Nebel. Marlon wird sofort rettungslos in Horizons Bann gezogen. Die jedoch verfolgt nur ein Ziel: Marlon und Leon gegeneinander auszuspielen. Ein bitterer Bruderkampf bricht aus und die Wilden Kerle drohen daran zu zerbrechen. Werden sie die größte Herausforderung ihres Lebens bestehen?","tagline":"Der Angriff der Silberlichten"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hfTuyoAIE6KtrrwAW26NXBXVFJI.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kcERl3Rkh8ogn48QJt7boGiMMPP.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":1264,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"de-DE","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]},"en":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]},"de":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hfTuyoAIE6KtrrwAW26NXBXVFJI.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hfTuyoAIE6KtrrwAW26NXBXVFJI.jpg","language":"de","width":1400,"height":2100